{"nodes": [{"id": "web_index_web_client", "label": "Web client (single-file phone/browser UI)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_screens", "label": "Five-screen state machine (title/pin/campaigns/wizard/play)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "showScreen publishes the active screen on #app's dataset so CSS can vary the frame per screen; a stray hello reporting no campaign must never yank the player out of the pin, wizard or title screens."}, {"id": "web_index_apifetch", "label": "apiFetch (credential header + 401 bounce)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_submitpin", "label": "submitPin", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "enterAfterAuth must be called explicitly here: the SSE hello handler deliberately never navigates away from the PIN screen, so without it a correct PIN validated server-side while the page stayed frozen (the launch-day phone bug)."}, {"id": "web_index_applyauthmode", "label": "applyAuthMode (shapes the single login field)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Defaults to the permissive 'code' mode so every path fails OPEN: a digits-only sanitiser left armed by a slow /api/auth-mode silently ate access codes as they were typed. 'none' (--no-pin) must skip the login screen entirely -- it previously demanded a 6-digit PIN that never existed."}, {"id": "web_index_boot", "label": "boot", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_enterafterauth", "label": "enterAfterAuth (landing rule)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Someone with campaigns goes straight to their shelf -- the title card is a front door, not a toll gate paid on every visit; someone with nothing to resume gets the title card rather than an empty list."}, {"id": "web_index_rendercampaignlist", "label": "renderCampaignList (campaign shelf)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_confirmdeletecampaign", "label": "confirmDeleteCampaign (inline confirm)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Confirmation replaces the card rather than opening a dialog, so the campaign being destroyed stays named and on screen while the player decides."}, {"id": "web_index_signout", "label": "signOut", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deliberately does NOT end the server-side session: signing out is a client act, and killing a live game because someone handed the phone over would lose the turn in flight."}, {"id": "web_index_continuecampaign", "label": "continueCampaign", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A 409 'session already running' still routes to the play screen (attaching to the live session via SSE is exactly right); any other error stays on the list instead of dumping the player on a dead play screen."}, {"id": "web_index_connectsse", "label": "connectSse (ticket exchange)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "POSTs /api/sse-ticket with the normal credential header and spends the one-shot ticket on the stream URL, so no long-lived secret ever appears in a query string; falls back to ?pin= so an older server still yields a working stream."}, {"id": "web_index_schedulessereconnect", "label": "scheduleSseReconnect (client-owned backoff)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "EventSource's built-in retry re-requests the SAME url, and the ticket in it is single-use -- after the first drop its automatic retries would 401 forever and the stream would be quietly dead. Each attempt must fetch a fresh ticket, so the source is closed and reopened with a growing backoff."}, {"id": "web_index_openeventstream", "label": "openEventStream (SSE event handlers)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_renderfeed", "label": "renderFeed / story feed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_appendfeedentry", "label": "appendFeedEntry", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Player entries render as an in-world prompt line ('\u00bb did X') rather than a chat bubble; the drop-cap is suppressed whenever an entry doesn't open on an actual letter, so a scene divider or stray markdown character isn't blown up into a giant glyph."}, {"id": "web_index_appendinlinemarkup", "label": "appendInlineMarkup (safe inline markdown)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Models narrate in light markdown whether asked or not, so *emphasis* must render rather than print asterisks. Built from real DOM nodes, never innerHTML, so narration can never inject markup; `_underscore_` is deliberately unsupported because snake_case item names would false-positive into italics."}, {"id": "web_index_autoscroll", "label": "autoScroll / isNearBottom", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The feed only auto-scrolls when the reader was already within 100px of the bottom; a player's own action and the first token of a fresh stream force it."}, {"id": "web_index_rendertopbar", "label": "renderTopbar (HUD crest + vitals)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_renderdrawer", "label": "renderDrawer (character sheet panel)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Content is kept current even while collapsed, because on desktop the same markup is a persistent sidebar forced visible by CSS rather than a phone drawer the player taps open."}, {"id": "web_index_renderinputstate", "label": "renderInputState (Act/Stop/thinking row)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stop replaces Send only once the DM turn is actually under way; while a roll card is up Stop is hidden entirely, mirroring the TUI rule that Esc must never interrupt a pending roll."}, {"id": "web_index_rendersuggestions", "label": "renderSuggestions (action chips)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tapping a chip PUTS IT IN THE INPUT rather than submitting it, so a suggestion is an editable starting point -- the goal is breaking the blank-page freeze, not turning the game into a menu. A dismiss button turns them off for good via localStorage."}, {"id": "web_index_flushledgertoast", "label": "flushLedgerToast (loot/XP toast)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ledger deltas accumulate silently while the turn is in flight and render as one combined 'YOU GAINED' entry when busy goes false, so a turn's gains arrive as a single beat instead of a stream of fragments."}, {"id": "web_index_renderrollsheet", "label": "renderRollSheet (dice bottom sheet)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A roll is the one moment the game takes the wheel, so it gets a modal sheet over the journal; nat 20 / nat 1 recolour the die and add a flourish, and the DM-authored reason stays in its own unpredictable-length block."}, {"id": "web_index_onrolltap", "label": "onRollTap (spin + POST race)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Promise.all of a minimum 1.3s spin and the confirm POST gives the reveal weight; reduced-motion collapses the wait to 150ms."}, {"id": "web_index_showrevealed", "label": "showRevealed / auto-dismiss", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The server broadcasts roll:null synchronously while resolving, which can race the POST response carrying the reveal; the dismiss is therefore scheduled from whichever side learns last, so the sheet is never yanked away before the player can read the result."}, {"id": "web_index_d20svg", "label": "d20Svg (true 3D icosahedron)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each of 20 facets is placed by a fully solved orthonormal basis (u, v, n) plus centroid, because aiming +Z at the outward normal alone leaves the roll about that normal unconstrained -- which is why an earlier rotateY/rotateX version scattered the triangles into a shard pile. A 13th baked Lambertian term shades each face for a fixed upper-left key light so the silhouette reads as a solid."}, {"id": "web_index_wizard", "label": "Web creation/retire wizard (4 dense steps)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Four dense steps, not nine sparse ones: every step used to be a single question alone on a full screen, so making a character was nine clicks before any fiction happened. The review is folded into whichever step is last (which differs between new and retire mode) so no step exists purely to confirm."}, {"id": "web_index_renderstepabilities", "label": "renderStepAbilities (assign scores)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Standard-array and rolled pools are kept side by side with their own assignments so switching tabs never loses the other; picking a value already used swaps the two positions instead of duplicating it."}, {"id": "web_index_basestatarray", "label": "baseStatArray (what gets POSTed)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sends the player's BASE assignment in STAT_ORDER because the server applies the racial bonus itself in buildCharacter; sending post-bonus numbers would double them."}, {"id": "web_index_displayfinalstats", "label": "displayFinalStats (post-race preview)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Display only. The old wizard printed the base pool under a heading that said 'Final', so an Elf who would really begin at DEX 17 was shown 15 on both the stats step and the review, then saw 17 in the HUD one screen later."}, {"id": "web_index_submitwizard", "label": "submitWizard", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "web_index_web_client", "target": "web_index_screens", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_boot", "target": "web_index_applyauthmode", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_boot", "target": "web_index_apifetch", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_boot", "target": "web_index_enterafterauth", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_submitpin", "target": "web_index_enterafterauth", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_enterafterauth", "target": "web_index_connectsse", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_enterafterauth", "target": "web_index_rendercampaignlist", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_rendercampaignlist", "target": "web_index_continuecampaign", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_rendercampaignlist", "target": "web_index_confirmdeletecampaign", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_confirmdeletecampaign", "target": "web_server_handledeletecampaign", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_connectsse", "target": "web_index_openeventstream", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_connectsse", "target": "web_index_schedulessereconnect", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_schedulessereconnect", "target": "web_index_connectsse", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_connectsse", "target": "web_server_sseticketstore", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_openeventstream", "target": "web_index_renderfeed", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_openeventstream", "target": "web_index_rendertopbar", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_openeventstream", "target": "web_index_renderrollsheet", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_openeventstream", "target": "web_index_renderinputstate", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_openeventstream", "target": "web_index_rendersuggestions", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_openeventstream", "target": "web_index_flushledgertoast", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_openeventstream", "target": "web_index_appendfeedentry", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_openeventstream", "target": "web_index_autoscroll", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_openeventstream", "target": "web_bridge_hellosnapshot", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_openeventstream", "target": "web_bridge_attach", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_renderfeed", "target": "web_index_appendfeedentry", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_appendfeedentry", "target": "web_index_appendinlinemarkup", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_rendertopbar", "target": "web_index_renderdrawer", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_rendertopbar", "target": "web_bridge_sanitizedstate", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_renderdrawer", "target": "web_server_handleend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_renderrollsheet", "target": "web_index_d20svg", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_renderrollsheet", "target": "web_index_onrolltap", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_onrolltap", "target": "web_index_showrevealed", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_onrolltap", "target": "web_server_handlerollconfirm", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_showrevealed", "target": "web_index_renderrollsheet", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_continuecampaign", "target": "web_server_handlecontinue", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_apifetch", "target": "web_server_checkpin", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_applyauthmode", "target": "web_server_requestlistener", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_wizard", "target": "web_index_renderstepabilities", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_wizard", "target": "web_index_submitwizard", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_renderstepabilities", "target": "web_index_displayfinalstats", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_displayfinalstats", "target": "web_index_basestatarray", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_submitwizard", "target": "web_index_basestatarray", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_submitwizard", "target": "web_server_handlenew", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_submitwizard", "target": "web_server_handleretire", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_wizard", "target": "web_server_handlepresets", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_renderstepabilities", "target": "web_server_handlerollstats", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_basestatarray", "target": "web_server_statsfromordered", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_signout", "target": "web_index_apifetch", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_rendersuggestions", "target": "web_bridge_transient_vs_mirrored_events", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "src/web/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}